{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1777.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"a687f7095d081eb72caf4896519e4b93ada672bfc289ff7fa5637ddab71e5aed","ja":"大人な中学生？","zh":"成熟的初中生？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1777.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"067cf57f374c1ebd9ad0245444d00cd147087c7fce2792dc6c327a5d1d0337a3","ja":"今日の朋花と可憐のお仕事は水族館でのグラビア撮影。\nただ、ちょっと難航していて……","zh":"今天朋花和可怜的工作是在水族馆拍摄写真。\n不过，进展似乎不太顺利……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1777.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"9ededb94d2b24a37d2d94165e9036c70b864c3e07fc4e08c9c10490d58103d55","ja":"あ……ええと……す、すみません。\n上手くできなかったので……もう一回……。","zh":"啊……那个……对、对不起。\n因为没能做好……再来一次……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1777.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"064f75ece0f2b459b7b0e7c2d597a316412cfc4172de01857c27fa0a07930fb2","ja":"「いえ、自分もすみません！　初めてのカメラマン\n相手だと緊張しちゃいますよね？　ええと……」","zh":"不，我也很抱歉！面对第一次合作的摄影师，确实会紧张吧？那个……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1777.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"60cdfbe99d5b510de1488bff6992b57e53f18ec878986aa32f0cf0475919c83e","ja":"丁寧に撮影していけば大丈夫ですよ～。\n落ち着いていきましょう～。","zh":"只要仔细拍摄就没问题哦～。\n冷静下来慢慢来吧～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1777.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"d999469e843b38979b47f87fb9aa75a5a192723b1c7110b9a51dac9c15379b5c","ja":"「……！　はい、そうですよね！\nではもう一度、ポーズをお願いします♪」","zh":"「……！是的，没错呢！  那么，请再摆一次姿势♪」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1777.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"44f7e51045705a96538db10938a2ebd92f2947d1b590830080a21becfbf76055","ja":"（あっ……困ってたカメラマンさんが……\n笑顔になった……！）","zh":"（啊……刚才还在犯难的摄影师先生……笑起来了……！）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1777.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"ef54bd50242bab5306672df2060011d22d64c1457ca4359f2a825cdcf0467a1d","ja":"と、朋花ちゃん。さっきは……ありがとう。\nそ、その……フォロー、してもらっちゃって。","zh":"那、那个……朋花。刚才……谢谢你。\n就、就是……还让你帮我解围了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1777.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"5523a70d4f6becfb3fd4361f5e2b55cd2abf0c395a34462a491d2e472bad52ea","ja":"私は……あ、焦ってばっかり、だったのに……。","zh":"我……明明一直都在……焦虑不安……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1777.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"c678f310b3962124897f00a84239d7209d2588d1136837fe03a63c740a1757dd","ja":"朋花ちゃんは、堂々としてて……本当にすごいよね。\n中学生なのに、大人っぽくって……。","zh":"小朋花总是落落大方……真的很厉害呢。\n明明还是初中生，却很有大人的感觉……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1777.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"4c6bdbb7188c8cdd50308569c476b29675d5b600e285b45d1aa5db3e50a6841f","ja":"いえ～、当然のことをしたまでですから～。\nそれより……。","zh":"哪里～我只是做了理所当然的事而已～。\n话说回来……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1777.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"8b525ad7b1b3abbf7450fed9077dc7964a6eea076592aa62e3e8588310af7984","ja":"せっかくなので、もう少し堪能したいのですが……。\nよかったらこの後、お魚を見ていきませんか～？","zh":"难得来一次，我还想再好好享受一会儿……  \n如果方便的话，接下来要不要一起去看看鱼呢～？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1777.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"f92ca450e31fbe17b9f6cae3d2a141ad64c6c67a45b936b498c7cd2c06fcc13c","ja":"いいの？　じ、実は……私も、気になってたんだ。\nあ、じゃあ……急いで着替えなきゃ……！","zh":"可以吗？其、其实……我也一直很在意。\n啊，那我得赶紧换衣服了……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1777.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"b6db21a0b8d3c2885c1a2a2fbba13c73ff9753f364364e7b46cfc070fc966cfa","ja":"ゆっくりで大丈夫ですよ～。\n閉館まで、まだ時間はありますから～。","zh":"慢慢来就好哦～。\n离闭馆还有时间呢～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
